        },
        "quote": "(a) All sewer lines in mobile home parks shall be laid in trenches separated at least five feet horizontally from any water supply lines. All sewer connections and manholes shall be so constructed as to prevent surface water from entering the sanitary sewer. The sewer shall be constructed of durable materials which are corrosion resistant and shall be so installed as to remain watertight and be rootproof.",
